  "description": "Round-trip latency (ping) measurement for SetNet. server.UsePing() periodically pings every connected peer and lets you read each player's RTT at any moment (Of(peer) → ms, smoothed + last); client.UsePing() answers server pings and can measure its own RTT to the server. Rides the unified protocol on Channels.Ping; monotonic Stopwatch timing. Depends only on SetNet.",
